      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIDNIGHT MADNESS (2) recorded her 2nd career win last time out (20.21) at Capalaba and drawn box 2 for the first time here. Well placed and will be tough to beat. IT'S AN ACE (1) jumped well and was in the mix early before fading out of it late when 7th over 350m at this track in P5 company. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Cannot be taken lightly. DAYSEA'S TIM (8) scored (19.73) last time out over 350m at this track three-and-a-half months ago. Record off this box is sound. This looks easier and expected to run well. VENOMOUS MISS (6) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
